  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.17 - on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.31. ComfyUI's own model files load as they are: Wan 2.2 (VAE, 5B DiT, umT5 fp16 / scaled fp8, and the tokenizer read from the umT5 file: Wan22Paths.ComfyUI), FLUX.2 klein (flux2-vae in either naming, the 4B transformer in bf16 or Black Forest Labs' fp8 kept 8-bit on the device, qwen_3_4b), FLUX.1's ae.safetensors; ComfyUI's FLUX.2 LATENT layout (patchified and batch-normalised) through Flux2Kernels.VaeToLatent / LatentToVae / LatentToTokens, measured against ComfyUI's own VAE Encode / Decode. Fixes: the native VAE's upsampling on AMD OpenCL at sizes that are not powers of two (the device's inexact fp32 division picked wrong pixels; the scale is now divided on the host), the native VAE on the CPU accelerator (GroupNorm group size). SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.30 / 5.4.31 fix unsigned division by powers of two and OpenCL signed overflow. Fix: CUDA graph replays waited for nothing before copying their inputs (a race with the caller's preprocessing; replayed detections drifted). See CHANGELOG.md.",
